<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces have expanded border patrols and fired warning shots after Myanmar bombs damaged a health centre and artillery struck villages in Tak and Mae Sot, prompting the Thai foreign minister to contact Myanmar officials about the fighting that injured Thai nationals. A 15‑year-old Thai golfer was killed and a caddy injured by lightning at a tournament in Chachoengsao. Residents near the Cambodia-Thailand checkpoint remain unable to return home while cross-border QR payment services are being rolled out in Bangkok. Cambodia is urging fast border demarcation with Thailand and has facilitated an observation mission along the Cambodia-Thailand border. 35 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNd19PM2xPTFBWTENXZDdTelM4NlRUbnJyc1F0czlZSHZKNHNHelRzVENaOUtOaGJOOHJGUEFtM29EdEQyejVkRlVHVDRWQ1BrMzVVdkVhbDRtY2VmZEwtWHgtQl9TZjhVQThOTldKM1ZIU3V1TFhpSEtRWUw5WDM2TGdtM1NZSVcteFBpZlp6ZHpfRGdYRERXb2lMYkVQQjRTUHpJcjA3NjhIcE0?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Diplomat – Asia-Pacific Current Affairs Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOa3BuZGxuQi0yVTZRakRYRzM5SHQ4TkV0WVpIb0RVeERRNlFqd3AxMFZUQ3F2Y2dYdkxYdGljcEV1TXdLcWVpeVdXbEQtOG5BLWQ5dDN6SnppQVBfSXBfTVUzTHpsVzF0UDhuYVhySkI4OHl4YUV5TUp4OEJJVDJFOEdkakFKeW9ETWExOHJSM1owUUpvY05ERjQ1bEZiaENjdFBhTWxBZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Karen News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;ISEAS – Yusof Ishak Institute&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;နိုင်ငံခြားရေးဝန်ကြီးဌာန&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNcl9JenlGWjVrR3U5cFJaY2Ruc0EwX240SDF0RTVzWUdjbVhKbkpxamZnaFpwVjE5WDhmU2JVeHI0UmtBdEFDVGRXNDhseHRzN0pubVNoX0NqX0hxWTlMTE92dDU4cDRyX0wyRWJKRlQ5YVpaaXdY